      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "ZIPPING KORDA (7) produced a moderate performance last time when sixth at this track over 425m behind Devington (24.30) in a Grade 5. Was in the money the start prior. Has performed well from this box with a win and two minor placings to her name from three starts. Tough to beat if on-song. WHOPPI DEVERE (2) has been mixing form lately, hitting the frame two back before finishing fourth (24.36) at this track in a Grade 5. Can improve sharply here. IVORY PANKE (1) was game in defeat off the inside draw last start, finishing third and beaten 1.5 lengths (24.34) behind Starlord Bale at this track. Goes well out of this box with a win and three minor placings. Nicely placed to grab a well-deserved win. PAW WONDER (3) is another with top-three prospects.",
